            </note>
            <note corresp="#d481-f2" n="81" xml:id="d481-f2-content">
                <p>Joachim von Ribbentrop, German Minister for Foreign Affairs.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d481-f3" n="82" xml:id="d481-f3-content">
                <p>Signed at Moscow on August 23, 1939; for text, see Department of State, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Nazi-Soviet Relations, 1939–1941</hi>, pp. 76–78, or <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Documents on German Foreign Policy, 1918–1945</hi>,
                    series D, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">vii</hi> (Washington, Government
                    Printing Office, 1956), pp. 245–247.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
